- **MinHook**: Copyright (c) 2009-2017 Tsuda Kageyu. BSD 2-Clause.
- **OpenVR SDK / `openvr_api.dll`**: Copyright (c) Valve Corporation. BSD 3-Clause.
- **Intel XeSS runtime**: Copyright (c) Intel Corporation. See `deps/LICENSES/XeSS_LICENSE.txt`.
- **AMD FidelityFX**: Copyright (c) Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. MIT License.
